WEBVTT

00:00:13.172 --> 00:00:16.862
The Tempest by William Shakespeare.

00:00:16.922 --> 00:00:22.851
Copyright Black Cat Publishing.

00:00:22.912 --> 00:00:29.126
Hello, my name's William Shakespeare.

00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:36.944
I was born in Stratford upon Avon in England on the 23rd of April 1564.

00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:40.947
I write plays, but I like to act too.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.360
In England I'm very famous.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.042
All sorts of people come and see my plays.

00:00:46.102 --> 00:00:49.174
Hamlet, Macbeth, Romeo and Juliet.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.806
Maybe you know them.

00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:58.158
I am the king of Naples.

00:00:58.218 --> 00:01:00.779
I am the king's son.

00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:03.630
And I am the king's brother.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.511
I am the Duke of Milan.

00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:07.402
And I am Prospero's brother.

00:01:07.462 --> 00:01:09.263
I'm not a good man.

00:01:09.283 --> 00:01:11.864
I am a good old man.

00:01:11.924 --> 00:01:14.186
I am the king's friend.

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:16.757
I am the real Duke of Milan.

00:01:16.817 --> 00:01:18.828
And I'm a magician.

00:01:18.887 --> 00:01:21.409
I'm Prospero's daughter.

00:01:21.469 --> 00:01:24.654
I'm a monster.

00:01:24.714 --> 00:01:28.099
And I'm a magic spirit.

00:01:28.159 --> 00:01:29.900
I'm a butler.

00:01:29.959 --> 00:01:32.300
I work on the kingship.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:39.032
I'm a jester and I work on the kingship too.

00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:44.004
Part 1.

00:01:44.064 --> 00:01:47.155
The Real Duke of Milan.

00:01:47.215 --> 00:01:53.340
Prospero is the real Duke of Milan, but he does not live in Milan.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:58.978
He lives on a small, lonely island with his beautiful young daughter, Miranda.

00:01:59.038 --> 00:02:03.852
Prospero doesn't want to live on this island, but he has no choice.

00:02:03.911 --> 00:02:12.308
His bad brother, Antonio, says he is the Duke of Milan, and Prospero cannot return to the city.

00:02:12.368 --> 00:02:17.742
Prospero and Miranda are not the only people on the little island.

00:02:17.802 --> 00:02:23.448
There is also a magic spirit called Ariel, and a monster called Caliban.

00:02:23.508 --> 00:02:29.103
Prospero is now their master, and they are his slaves.

00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:31.966
Prospero is a magician.

00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:37.931
He is very clever, and he knows a lot about magic and spells from his books.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:41.604
Ariel helps Prospero with his magic.

00:02:41.664 --> 00:02:50.322
Alonso, Antonio, Alonso's son Ferdinand, Sebastian, and Gonzalo are on the king's boat.

00:02:50.382 --> 00:02:54.494
Prospero decides to punish his brother Antonio.

00:02:54.554 --> 00:03:01.008
He is going to send a big storm, a tempest.

00:03:01.068 --> 00:03:05.801
Part one.

00:03:05.861 --> 00:03:09.243
That's the King of Naples.

00:03:09.303 --> 00:03:11.404
And that's the Duke of Milan.

00:03:11.464 --> 00:03:12.875
Hello, everybody.

00:03:12.895 --> 00:03:15.890
Hello, my friend.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.286
Excuse me.

00:03:18.346 --> 00:03:19.227
Yes?

00:03:19.286 --> 00:03:20.378
Yes.

00:03:20.438 --> 00:03:23.039
I'm the Duke of Milan, not him.

00:03:23.099 --> 00:03:24.650
He is my brother.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.811
My very bad brother.

00:03:26.831 --> 00:03:28.182
Oh?

00:03:28.242 --> 00:03:30.364
Oh?

00:03:30.424 --> 00:03:31.664
Ha ha ha ha.

00:03:31.724 --> 00:03:33.016
Sorry brother.

00:03:33.076 --> 00:03:35.407
I am strong and you are not.

00:03:35.467 --> 00:03:39.360
Now I am the Duke and you are a poor man.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:47.819
Now I live in your castle and you live on a small island.

00:03:47.879 --> 00:03:58.778
Now my bad brother is the Duke and I live on this small island with my daughter Miranda.

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:07.502
Yes, 12 years on this small island with my father and Caliban and Ariel.

00:04:07.562 --> 00:04:09.413
Who is Caliban?

00:04:09.473 --> 00:04:11.404
Who is Ariel?

00:04:11.464 --> 00:04:13.894
They are my slaves.

00:04:13.954 --> 00:04:16.503
No, they're not, Father.

00:04:16.563 --> 00:04:21.576
Caliban is a monster, and Ariel is a magic spirit.

00:04:21.636 --> 00:04:23.377
Listen, Miranda.

00:04:23.437 --> 00:04:26.849
I want to punish my brother and the king.

00:04:26.909 --> 00:04:30.180
I want to do some magic.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.282
My father has a magic book.

00:04:33.342 --> 00:04:38.446
He reads his book every day, and he does lots of magic.

00:04:38.506 --> 00:04:41.366
I want to make a storm.

00:04:41.426 --> 00:04:46.548
Tempest, I want to make a Tempest to punish the Duke.

00:04:46.608 --> 00:04:59.177
The next day, the King and the Duke are in a boat, and Prospero makes a magic Tempest.

00:04:59.237 --> 00:05:05.942
Ariel, be quiet.

00:05:06.002 --> 00:05:09.646
I want to listen to the television.

00:05:09.706 --> 00:05:10.997
Why?

00:05:11.057 --> 00:05:13.028
What program is it?

00:05:13.088 --> 00:05:14.818
Is it football?

00:05:14.878 --> 00:05:16.089
No.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.970
It's the weather forecast.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:22.881
I want to know the weather for tomorrow.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.681
Today is a beautiful day.

00:05:25.741 --> 00:05:27.462
I don't know.

00:05:27.522 --> 00:05:31.543
It's sunny, but it's windy too.

00:05:31.603 --> 00:05:34.084
Perhaps it will rain tomorrow.

00:05:34.104 --> 00:05:35.804
Shhh.

00:05:35.824 --> 00:05:39.038
The weather forecast starting now.

00:05:39.098 --> 00:05:42.583
Good evening and welcome to the weather forecast.

00:05:42.643 --> 00:05:48.076
There will be snow on the mountains tomorrow, but it will be sunny near the sea.

00:05:48.136 --> 00:05:51.057
It will be cloudy in the afternoon.

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:55.876
The next day stay at home, because it will be very stormy.

00:05:55.936 --> 00:05:58.444
There will be a big tempest.

00:05:58.504 --> 00:05:59.815
Oh no!

00:05:59.836 --> 00:06:03.078
A big tempest tomorrow!

00:06:03.138 --> 00:06:05.170
What's a tempest?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.724
Don't you know, Caliban?

00:06:07.784 --> 00:06:13.008
A tempest is a big, big storm.

00:06:13.068 --> 00:06:18.726
Now listen to the conversation again.

00:06:18.786 --> 00:06:23.792
Ariel, be quiet.

00:06:23.852 --> 00:06:26.925
I want to listen to the television.

