00:07:32.846 --> 00:07:42.140
Part 2 The men are at sea when a big storm begins.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:49.032
The wind is blowing hard, and the big waves almost go over the top of the boat.

00:07:49.092 --> 00:07:52.033
The men are all very afraid.

00:07:52.093 --> 00:07:54.594
A man is steering the boat.

00:07:54.654 --> 00:07:59.726
He tries to stop it from going under the waves, but it is impossible.

00:07:59.786 --> 00:08:05.067
They start shouting for help, they must leave the ship to save themselves.

00:08:05.127 --> 00:08:09.230
There is a small island not too far away.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:14.594
The men don't know this, and they don't know it is a magic tempest.

00:08:14.653 --> 00:08:18.686
From a distance, Prospero is watching the storm.

00:08:18.746 --> 00:08:23.750
His magic is working well, but Ariel's work is not finished.

00:08:23.809 --> 00:08:33.934
Prospero has plans for the men, but first, they must arrive on the island.

00:08:33.994 --> 00:08:40.466
Good morning, Your Majesty.

00:08:40.525 --> 00:08:43.178
Good morning, Antonio.

00:08:43.238 --> 00:08:45.830
It's very windy today.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.962
Good morning, Father.

00:08:48.022 --> 00:08:49.873
Good morning, Antonio.

00:08:49.933 --> 00:08:52.865
Look at the big waves.

00:08:52.925 --> 00:08:56.628
There's a big storm today.

00:08:56.648 --> 00:08:57.138
Look!

00:08:57.199 --> 00:09:08.090
Look!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:18.409
Very good, Ariel.

00:09:18.469 --> 00:09:19.929
Yes, sir.

00:09:19.989 --> 00:09:22.380
Your magic is very good.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.042
You are very intelligent.

00:09:25.102 --> 00:09:26.372
Yes, I know.

00:09:26.432 --> 00:09:28.163
Thank you, Ariel.

00:09:28.223 --> 00:09:31.824
Is the magic finished, sir?

00:09:31.884 --> 00:09:33.845
Can I go now?

00:09:33.905 --> 00:09:35.146
No, Ariel.

00:09:35.206 --> 00:09:41.566
There is more magic for you to do.

00:09:41.626 --> 00:09:47.197
Good morning, Antonio.

00:09:47.257 --> 00:09:48.728
Are you sleeping?

00:09:48.788 --> 00:09:51.372
Oh, good morning, Your Majesty.

00:09:51.432 --> 00:09:52.534
What time is it?

00:09:52.594 --> 00:09:55.328
It's half past seven, Antonio.

00:09:55.388 --> 00:09:56.959
Come on, get up.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.492
Today is not a good day.

00:09:59.552 --> 00:10:00.123
Why?

00:10:00.184 --> 00:10:01.305
What's the problem?

00:10:01.365 --> 00:10:03.952
There is a big storm coming.

00:10:04.012 --> 00:10:07.987
The sky is black, and the sea is angry.

00:10:08.047 --> 00:10:10.649
And where is your son Ferdinand the Prince?

00:10:10.709 --> 00:10:13.270
Ferdinand is reading the book.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.281
And where is Gonzalo?

00:10:15.342 --> 00:10:18.334
Gonzalo is an old man.

00:10:18.394 --> 00:10:21.345
He is sleepy.

00:10:21.405 --> 00:10:22.866
Listen, you majesty.

00:10:22.926 --> 00:10:24.858
What's that noise?

00:10:24.918 --> 00:10:31.884
It's the storm, Antonio.

00:10:31.944 --> 00:10:39.442
