00:12:07.808 --> 00:12:54.805
Famous shipwrecks.

00:12:54.866 --> 00:12:58.297
The Mary Celeste.

00:12:58.357 --> 00:12:59.867
It is 1872.

00:12:59.927 --> 00:13:02.318
A beautiful ship leaves New York.

00:13:02.378 --> 00:13:04.918
It is going to Genoa in Italy.

00:13:04.978 --> 00:13:08.830
The ship is carrying a lot of barrels of alcohol.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:18.563
A few months later, the captain of a Portuguese ship, de Glazia, sees a very strange thing between the islands of the Azores and Portugal.

00:13:18.623 --> 00:13:23.204
There is a ship in the sea, but there is no one on it.

00:13:23.264 --> 00:13:26.176
where are the captain and his men?

00:13:26.236 --> 00:13:29.820
People call it a ghost ship.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:36.826
The Portuguese take the ship to Gibraltar, and they use it again, but it brings bad luck.

00:13:36.886 --> 00:13:41.930
There is bad weather near Haiti, and the ship sinks there.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:46.104
Today, many people go to visit the shipwreck.

00:13:46.164 --> 00:13:50.540
They dive underwater and try to discover the mystery.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:55.246
but nobody really knows the true story of the Mary Celeste.

00:13:55.306 --> 00:13:58.429
What do you think it is?

00:13:58.489 --> 00:14:01.372
The Titanic.

00:14:01.432 --> 00:14:08.118
When we think about famous shipwrecks in history, we nearly always think about the Titanic.

00:14:08.178 --> 00:14:11.350
Wednesday, the 10th of April, 1912.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:16.254
The Titanic leaves Southampton to sail to New York.

00:14:16.314 --> 00:14:20.394
They say it is impossible for the ship to sink.

00:14:20.454 --> 00:14:23.722
And there are rich people travelling first class.

00:14:23.782 --> 00:14:28.056
They want to go to New York because they like travelling.

00:14:28.116 --> 00:14:31.219
There are also a lot of poor people.

00:14:31.278 --> 00:14:33.660
They travel third class.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.903
They want to start a new life in America.

00:14:37.963 --> 00:14:46.737
A few days later, not far from Halifax on the northeast coast of Canada, the captain sees a big iceberg.

00:14:46.797 --> 00:14:51.249
But it is too late, and the ship hits the iceberg.

00:14:51.269 --> 00:14:58.253
Eventually the ship breaks and sinks vertically into the cold sea.

00:14:58.313 --> 00:15:03.636
Many people die, but some people escape on lifeboats.

00:15:03.696 --> 00:15:14.188
Most of the survivors are first class passengers, Why do you think this is?

00:15:14.248 --> 00:15:27.158
Part 3 More of Ariel's Magic All the people from the Kings boat are still alive.

00:15:27.218 --> 00:15:31.392
They don't know they are on the island or why they are there.

00:15:31.452 --> 00:15:35.618
They are all very tired and they are sleeping.

00:15:35.678 --> 00:15:41.898
Ariel calls to Ferdinand and wakes him up by singing sweetly in his ear.

00:15:41.958 --> 00:15:48.402
Ferdinand follows the sound of this magical song and meets Prospero and Miranda.

00:15:48.462 --> 00:15:50.904
Prospero knows what to do.

00:15:50.964 --> 00:15:55.477
He wants Ferdinand and Miranda to fall in love.

00:15:55.537 --> 00:16:01.554
Ferdinand immediately thinks Miranda is beautiful and tells her that he loves her.

00:16:01.614 --> 00:16:04.409
She tells him that she loves him too.

00:16:04.469 --> 00:16:06.430
But is it real?

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:10.462
Or is it only a spell?

00:16:10.522 --> 00:16:17.986
Part 3 Everybody is sleeping.

00:16:18.046 --> 00:16:21.622
I must find Ferdinand and wake him.

00:16:21.682 --> 00:16:29.954
Time to wake up, time to wake up, studying and come with me.

00:16:30.014 --> 00:16:34.588
Time to do some magic, time to do some magic.

00:16:34.648 --> 00:16:36.630
Where am I?

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.192
What's that noise?

00:16:38.252 --> 00:16:41.384
I hear a song.

00:16:41.444 --> 00:16:44.123
A beautiful song.

00:16:44.183 --> 00:16:48.442
It is a beautiful song.

00:16:48.502 --> 00:16:50.573
Wait for me.

00:16:50.613 --> 00:16:54.416
Wait for me.

00:16:54.476 --> 00:16:58.007
Here is Ferdinand, sir.

00:16:58.067 --> 00:16:59.578
Very good Ariel.

00:16:59.638 --> 00:17:03.580
You can go now.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:08.142
Who are you?

00:17:08.203 --> 00:17:10.534
What's your name?

00:17:10.594 --> 00:17:13.218
My name is Miranda.

00:17:13.279 --> 00:17:16.973
You're very beautiful, Miranda.

00:17:17.034 --> 00:17:18.634
I love you.

00:17:18.694 --> 00:17:23.246
I love you, too.

00:17:23.306 --> 00:17:29.628
Part 4, an evil plan.

00:17:29.688 --> 00:17:33.790
Sebastian and Antonio wake up on the island.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:40.968
Antonio tells Sebastian to kill his brother, then Sebastian will be King of Naples.

00:17:41.028 --> 00:17:47.913
Sebastian agrees to the plan, but he is thinking about Gonzalo, the king's friend.

00:17:47.973 --> 00:17:53.344
They must kill him too, or he will know about the king's murder.

00:17:53.404 --> 00:17:59.196
But Ariel hears their plan and sings in Gonzalo's ear.

00:17:59.256 --> 00:18:05.647
Gonzalo and the king wake up and see Antonio and Sebastian with their swords in the air.

00:18:05.707 --> 00:18:10.652
Antonio and Sebastian look very stupid and embarrassed.

00:18:10.712 --> 00:18:16.562
They tell a story about wanting to protect the king from some animals.

00:18:16.622 --> 00:18:22.278
Fortunately for them, and for Ariel, the king believes their story.

00:18:22.337 --> 00:18:31.170
They all go to look for Ferdinand, the king's son.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:37.388
Where are we?

00:18:37.448 --> 00:18:39.350
Wake up, Sebastian!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.592
We are on an island.

00:18:41.652 --> 00:18:44.094
Look, the others are sleeping.

00:18:44.154 --> 00:18:47.867
This is an excellent opportunity for you, Sebastian.

00:18:47.927 --> 00:18:48.948
Why?

00:18:49.008 --> 00:18:54.732
If you kill your brother, the King, you can be the new King of Naples.

00:18:54.792 --> 00:18:56.334
Good idea.

00:18:56.394 --> 00:18:57.504
No.

00:18:57.564 --> 00:18:59.556
Wait a minute.

00:18:59.616 --> 00:19:03.420
Gonzalo is the King's friend.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.198
You kill the King.

00:19:05.258 --> 00:19:07.760
and I kill Gonzalo.

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.264
Okay!

00:19:09.324 --> 00:19:12.611
Let's do it now, before they wake up!

00:19:12.671 --> 00:19:18.088
Are you ready?

00:19:18.148 --> 00:19:23.142
Oh no!

00:19:23.202 --> 00:19:25.084
This is terrible!

00:19:25.144 --> 00:19:28.855
I must stop this terrible plan!

00:19:28.915 --> 00:19:31.526
One, two, three!

00:19:31.586 --> 00:19:33.507
Time to wake!

00:19:33.567 --> 00:19:34.948
Where are we?

00:19:34.968 --> 00:19:35.658
Wake up!

00:19:35.718 --> 00:19:37.854
Your Majesty!

00:19:37.914 --> 00:19:42.544
What are you doing with your sword, Antonio?

00:19:42.604 --> 00:19:44.915
Nothing, Your Majesty.

00:19:44.975 --> 00:19:48.367
There are lots of dangerous animals on the island.

00:19:48.427 --> 00:19:50.358
Yes, we want to protect you.

00:19:50.418 --> 00:19:53.100
Very good, very good.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:20:00.566
Now let's find my son, Ferdinand.

00:20:00.626 --> 00:20:05.719
Part 5.

00:20:05.779 --> 00:20:11.798
Caliban's Cloak Caliban is very sad.

