00:36:12.216 --> 00:36:18.428
Ariel takes Alonso, Gonzalo, Sebastian and Antonio to Prospero.

00:36:18.488 --> 00:36:21.318
They say sorry to Prospero.

00:36:21.379 --> 00:36:25.890
Prospero is angry, but he decides to forgive them.

00:36:25.950 --> 00:36:33.952
Alonso thanks Prospero, but he is still very sad because he thinks his son Ferdinand is dead.

00:36:34.012 --> 00:36:37.406
Prospero then gives him the good news.

00:36:37.466 --> 00:36:39.628
His son is not dead.

00:36:39.688 --> 00:36:41.899
He is with Miranda.

00:36:41.959 --> 00:36:45.940
Ferdinand introduces Miranda to his father.

00:36:46.000 --> 00:36:51.160
Alonso is pleased about the news about his son and his new daughter.

00:36:51.220 --> 00:36:55.941
Just at that moment, Stefano, Trinkio and Caliban arrive.

00:36:56.001 --> 00:36:57.422
The dogs are behind them.

00:36:57.482 --> 00:36:59.252
They are chasing them.

00:36:59.312 --> 00:37:04.968
Prospero forgives them as well, and tells Caliban he is free.

00:37:05.028 --> 00:37:08.545
He can now be master of the island.

00:37:08.606 --> 00:37:10.958
He also frees Ariel.

00:37:11.018 --> 00:37:13.940
They are both very happy.

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:19.145
Ferdinand and Miranda want to marry as soon as possible.

00:37:19.206 --> 00:37:23.068
Prospero does not need to do any more magic now.

00:37:23.129 --> 00:37:26.132
He prepares to return to Milan.

00:37:26.192 --> 00:37:35.701
But first, he is going to organise a big party for them all.

00:37:35.761 --> 00:37:44.337
Now, I must speak to my brother Antonio and the others.

00:37:44.398 --> 00:37:45.738
Here they are.

00:37:45.798 --> 00:37:47.228
I don't believe it.

00:37:47.288 --> 00:37:49.039
My brother, Prospero.

00:37:49.099 --> 00:37:52.700
Antonio, you are a bad man.

00:37:52.760 --> 00:37:56.681
Sebastian, Alonso, you are bad men too.

00:37:56.741 --> 00:37:58.371
Yes, Prospero.

00:37:58.431 --> 00:37:59.622
You're right.

00:37:59.682 --> 00:38:03.993
We are bad men, but we're very sorry now.

00:38:04.053 --> 00:38:05.774
My poor brother.

00:38:05.834 --> 00:38:07.564
I'm very sorry.

00:38:07.624 --> 00:38:09.065
Please forgive me.

00:38:09.125 --> 00:38:11.446
Of course I forgive you.

00:38:11.506 --> 00:38:13.516
I forgive you all.

00:38:13.576 --> 00:38:15.998
I am very happy for this.

00:38:16.058 --> 00:38:19.949
But I am very sad because my son is lost.

00:38:20.009 --> 00:38:21.900
Perhaps he's dead.

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:22.810
No.

00:38:22.870 --> 00:38:24.511
Here is your son.

00:38:24.571 --> 00:38:25.841
He's not lost.

00:38:25.901 --> 00:38:28.682
He's here with my daughter Miranda.

00:38:28.742 --> 00:38:29.983
Father.

00:38:30.043 --> 00:38:32.630
Furd in hand.

00:38:32.690 --> 00:38:36.158
This is Miranda.

00:38:36.218 --> 00:38:38.520
I love her very much.

00:38:38.580 --> 00:38:40.532
We want to get married.

00:38:40.592 --> 00:38:42.214
I'm very happy.

00:38:42.274 --> 00:38:44.175
This is very good news.

00:38:44.235 --> 00:38:52.000
Let's celebrate!

00:38:52.060 --> 00:39:03.717
Caliban, Stefano, and Triculo, I forgive you three too.

00:39:03.777 --> 00:39:06.128
Thank you, sir.

00:39:06.188 --> 00:39:11.202
When I return to Milan with my brother, you can have your island.

00:39:11.263 --> 00:39:12.954
You can be master.

00:39:13.014 --> 00:39:15.976
Master of the island.

00:39:16.036 --> 00:39:19.536
Thank you, sir.

00:39:19.596 --> 00:39:23.938
Can I live on the island too?

00:39:23.998 --> 00:39:25.370
Yes, Ariel.

00:39:25.430 --> 00:39:28.384
You and Caliban are now free.

00:39:28.444 --> 00:39:30.318
You are not my slaves.

00:39:30.378 --> 00:39:34.928
You can do what you want to do.

00:39:34.988 --> 00:39:39.425
Now everything is organized.

00:39:39.485 --> 00:39:44.208
Tonight, apart party, and tomorrow we must return to Milan together.

00:39:44.268 --> 00:39:52.123
Ferdinand de Miranda want to get to get married and Caliban and Ariel can be masters of their island.

00:39:52.183 --> 00:39:57.906
I must do no more magic because our story is finished.

00:39:57.966 --> 00:40:07.472
If you like it, please clap to break the spell.

00:40:07.532 --> 00:40:14.271
you

